Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 21:39:09 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 09/37] tools/aurora-sep: add idle-ab.py

Compare CPU idle settings by SMC Total System Power on a running machine:
default, CPU PD disabled, WFI disabled, or a CPU PD target residency
(cpuidle_apple.pd_residency_us). Rounds alternate the order, and the
report pairs each setting with the first by round, since a busy machine's
load drifts by watts. Every knob it writes is put back on exit, also on an
error or Ctrl-C.

